## Why This Is Asked
This checks practical CV setup, leakage awareness, and model selection on small data.

## Key Concepts
- Data leakage prevention
- Stratified cross-validation
- Pipeline preprocessing
- Model comparison metrics (AUROC, calibration)

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: stratified K-fold CV in JS-like syntax
const k = 5;
const folds = stratifiedKFoldSplit(labels, k);
for (const [trainIdx, testIdx] of folds) {
  const model = trainLogisticRegression(features[trainIdx], labels[trainIdx]);
  const preds = model.predictProba(features[testIdx]);
  console.log(rocAuc(labels[testIdx], preds));
}
```

